"""Tailors the guide to its reader: a practising transportation engineer and planner who finished a civil engineering degree
about six years ago and is re-learning the rest of the subject for the exam. Each topic overview gets a short bridge (what
usually sticks, what needs rebuilding, where the topic meets transportation work, and where the exam differs from practice),
and lessons with a real link to street and traffic work get a one-line note. Run after author_rev.py."""
import json, os
from author_common import ROOT
